+---
+title: 'DW-121/DW-122 candidate-scoped bounded reads'
+type: 'bugfix'
+created: '2026-09-14'
+status: 'in-review'
+baseline_revision: '087c76b18a8ad462498653651a3fcb971e31baf4'
+baseline_commit: '087c76b18a8ad462498653651a3fcb971e31baf4'
